@linxin666/dsh-pet README · Status decorations (decoration.json, pet-center M5, #567)：- Structure is fail-closed (unknown fields, out-of-range geometry, non-PNG/WebP entries reject with diagnostics); segment content is warn-and-drop. The machine-readable twin lives at contracts/status-decoration-v1.schema.json; the authoritative validator is src/decoration.ts.
- Sources: built-in assets/decorations/ plus the user directory $DSH_HOME/pets/decorations/<id>/ (same id overrides the built-in). Assets ride /api/pet/decoration/<id>/<file> with the same containment and allow-lists as pet assets.
- Switch: Settings > Pet > Status decoration (on by default). The built-in whale derives from the DeepSeek wordmark (MIT); see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

@linxin666/dsh-pet README · Plugin panel actions (pet.registerPanelAction)：Host-side sibling plugins can add their own button to the pet's hover panel action row, next to the built-in Feed / Rename / Hide:

```ts
ctx.effect(() => ctx.pet.registerPanelAction({
  id: 'pet-quota-swap',            // kebab id; a click dispatches back on it
  label: '换装',                    // bounded label (the row wraps past it)
  title: '切换到下一只宠物',         // optional tooltip
